\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"ee513cfa5b9e69b1bb851f76e267a3caa5969808e6c161ae15c74b0686c47527","event_uuid":"555bdd70-70ab-4499-a0b9-bd4406c2b2fb","position":{"commit_sha":"19a8639259b5f5b6278388d4506b8da1a0186fc8","position":"1793803719133809001-555bdd70-70ab-4499-a0b9-bd4406c2b2fb"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"ed6f4d6a411f4a179e6288e4dc937d71b30a89b628acc5e3906df97c5b6758cf","event_uuid":"6c00b629-5723-4389-a93f-13cbb3ac84bd","position":{"commit_sha":"6ff08b0f38db22e70bebfa43285e5d33ce2d3783","position":"1793803780741794001-6c00b629-5723-4389-a93f-13cbb3ac84bd"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"duplicate","comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Related closed tickets to check first (no open duplicate found by search for the test name, 'xdist worker crashed', and 'node down Not properly terminated'): soppy-logophilic-husky (a per-test hang budget killed xdist workers) and uneducated-conveyable-nabarlek (xdist worker died during a slow, loaded make verify). Whether a per-test wall budget fired here is unchecked; the isolated 204-297 s passes did not hit one.","timestamp":1793798911066234001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Duplicate of subsolar-sonorous-puppy (in progress). Same test, test_benchmark_commit_count_is_ceil_per_pass. The worker crash is how this suite reports a timeout: pytest-timeout runs with timeout_method=thread, and on expiry calls os._exit(1) inside the xdist worker, so an over-budget test shows as 'Not properly terminated' with no traceback (root-caused in uneducated-conveyable-nabarlek, Gerrit 3293; the reporting gap is filed as delighted-worthless-foal). subsolar-sonorous-puppy measured this test at 302-537 s against the 300 s limit under load and is fixing its per-comment git cost. This run's 3-5 min standalone timings fit that.","timestamp":1793803562996966001}],"completion_expectation":"disposition","created_at":1793798658958545001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"f89b81e9-ec23-4a2c-9e91-ad75388d41aa","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e594-b9b0-304f-4496"},{"link_uuid":"d7e25144-cb24-4dca-a2b2-2fc8f16367a6","relation":"duplicates","target_id":"571b-f552-5fa7-4b74"}],"description":"## Observation\n\n2026-11-04 PST, worktree fix-jaeger at commit d413a0497e5 (bug bronze-commonable-jaeger, MCP auth wiring only). The integration tier as `make test` runs it (`pytest -m integration -n 4 --dist loadgroup --max-worker-restart=0 -q`) reported `1 failed, 201 passed, 3 skipped in 736.10s`. The failure was not an assertion: xdist worker gw2 terminated abnormally (\"node down: Not properly terminated\"; the rebar crash guard reported it) while running `tests/interfaces/io/test_import_batch_resume.py::test_benchmark_commit_count_is_ceil_per_pass`. The tier normally takes about 3 min 40 s; this run took 12 min 16 s.\n\nHost state shortly after: load average about 28-33 on 18 cores, `memory_pressure` reporting 14% free.\n\nIsolated reruns on the same tree all passed, but each took 204-297 s (3 runs: 250.8 s, 204.6 s, 297.5 s).\n\n## Hypotheses (unproven)\n\n- The worker process was killed under memory pressure (for example by the OS) while this long-running benchmark held a large working set.\n- The benchmark's runtime under load crossed a worker-level limit that ends the process abnormally.\n- Another defect in the test or the import batch path that only shows under parallel load.\n\n## Next check\n\nRerun the integration tier with per-worker peak RSS recorded, and check the macOS unified log for a jetsam/kill event for the worker pid at the crash time. A kill event would point at memory; no kill plus a stack would point at the test itself.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Root cause identified with evidence recorded as a ticket comment.\n- [ ] `pytest -m integration -n 4 --dist loadgroup --max-worker-restart=0 -q` completes with no worker crash in this test on a loaded host, or the class of failure is fixed with a regression test.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"555bdd70-70ab-4499-a0b9-bd4406c2b2fb","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"9580-52b1-252f-46eb","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Integration worker crashes in test_benchmark_commit_count_is_ceil_per_pass under load","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["d70daf54-ed7e-4f69-b24c-23e6812e2a20","f89b81e9-ec23-4a2c-9e91-ad75388d41aa","1a935db7-e29d-40a3-96a6-009f5d7ecefa","a9f95dc3-c441-4516-9597-4f965eb3b179","d7e25144-cb24-4dca-a2b2-2fc8f16367a6","555bdd70-70ab-4499-a0b9-bd4406c2b2fb","6c00b629-5723-4389-a93f-13cbb3ac84bd"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793803780741794002,"uuid":"47e011b8-7dc2-4040-a36f-6ce1277a3222"}